<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="container" style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem; max-width: 900px;">
  <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
    <div class="badge badge-success" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Support & Knowledge</div>
    <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Frequently Asked <span class="grad-text">Questions</span></h1>
    <p class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 1.1rem;">
      Common questions regarding daily ROI, compensation caps, withdrawals, and network rankings.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
    <div class="card" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--c-mint);">How is Daily ROI calculated?</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Daily ROI is 2.0% of your active package base amount. For example, a $500 package generates $10.00 daily, while a $1,000 package generates $20.00 daily. ROI is calculated once every 24 hours via an automated cron ledger.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--c-mint);">What is the difference between Working ID and Investor ID?</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Working IDs qualify for up to a 3X total income multiplier cap on package purchases, ideal for network builders who refer partners. Investor IDs receive a 2X total income cap. Both multipliers are configurable in the admin panel.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--c-mint);">How does the Level Unlock system work?</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Level unlock follows the 1 Direct = 1 Level Unlock rule. Having 1 active direct referral unlocks Level 1 ROI-on-ROI overrides. Having 5 direct referrals unlocks Level 5, and maintaining 20 active direct referrals unlocks all 20 downline levels.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--c-mint);">How is Weekly Salary activated and upgraded?</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Weekly salary is based on direct business volume. When you reach $1,000 direct volume, you earn $20/week for 25 weeks. When you achieve the next target ($3,000), your previous salary level is stopped immediately and the new $50/week salary activates for a fresh 25-week cycle!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 1.75rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--c-mint);">What are the withdrawal fees and limits?</h3>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Standard withdrawal fee is 10% (configurable by Admin). Minimum withdrawal is $10.00 USD, and maximum single request limit is $50,000.00 USD. Requests are processed into your designated crypto wallet.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
